      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "The metric name 'throughput_tflops_per_sec_per_gpu' uses lowercase 'tflops' which is inconsistent with the standard acronym capitalization. Consider using 'throughput_TFLOPS_per_sec_per_gpu' or 'throughput_TFLOPs_per_sec_per_gpu' for better clarity and consistency with common technical writing standards.\n```suggestion\n                        mlflow_writer.log_metric(\"throughput_TFLOPS_per_sec_per_gpu\", throughput, iteration)\n```",
      "commit_id": "5aa5070849810623dc77d829db120f7507571425",
